WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:36.050
Kaiba entrusted me with Fiend's Sanctuary, the card to defeat Ra.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:42.040
This card's effect stops One Turn Kill and leads you to defeat, Marik!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.800
What?  You escaped using De-Fusion?

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:51.140
But Fiend's Sanctuary is a magical sanctuary that stops one God and summons another.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:53.330
Come, Obelisk!

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.730
Attack Marik directly!

00:01:55.730 --> 00:02:01.730
Immortal Wall  Egyptian God Slime

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:21.990
Due to Obelisk's direct attack, you take 4000 points of damage, Marik!

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.800
Way to go, Yugi!

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:30.440
Nice!  Marik barely has any life points left!

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:34.020
See that?  Obelisk blew away Marik!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.740
That felt great!

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:38.080
If he keeps going, he'll win!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.170
Yugi is incredible!

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:45.440
Marik let Obelisk attack him that easily?

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:46.740
Something's up.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.250
Can Marik's set card be...

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.520
Yugi, be careful.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:01.960
If Marik took Obelisk's attack on purpose, he has two strategies ready.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.260
Ouch...

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:10.000
The first is to corner you and deal emotional damage.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.500
The second is...

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:17.610
Look at Yugi's expression.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.340
What's wrong?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.200
What's going on?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.350
He's about to win, but he looks like he's losing.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:34.860
That hurt, Yugi.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.060
It hurt a lot.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:49.820
But Yugi, I hope you haven't forgotten that he feels the real pain instead of me.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:54.160
The darkness will devour his body equal to the damage.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.250
Marik!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.500
He's pitiful.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:05.260
As a gravekeeper, he sacrificed his entire life to protect the Pharaoh's memories.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.760
And this is the result.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:13.740
His destiny is to be killed by the Pharaoh.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:18.250
It's so ironic that it makes me laugh.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:27.000
He's a delicious sacrifice seasoned with the spice of hatred towards you.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.150
My other self!

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:33.520
If you keep attacking, Marik's true self will vanish!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.520
But if I lose, you'll fall to the darkness.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.860
I'm still fine.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.800
The true enemy we must defeat is...

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.260
...Marik's evil soul!

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.800
We must save Marik's true self for Ishizu.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.700
I know there must be a way!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.070
Yeah.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.080
But how?

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.160
Yugi.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:08.080
I will consume your spirit and feed your flesh to the darkness.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:13.040
The pain Obelisk dealt me...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:16.550
I'll make you feel it twice as hard.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.200
I knew it.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:23.370
Marik took Obelisk's attack because he has another strategy.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:29.610
I'll show you that letting you summon your God was part of my trap.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.060
R-Rishido...

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.620
Rishido!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.700
Rishido.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.660
Rishido...

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:58.040
I'll soon head to the world of darkness.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:01.670
But I want to tell you something first.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:06.180
I disobeyed my family's laws and committed crimes.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:13.220
Even an eternity of darkness won't make up for what I did to my father.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.420
I'll kill you first, Father.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.260
Don't!

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.930
My dark side did that instead of me.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:33.800
But I'm the one who created my dark side.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:39.940
Because my hate towards destiny and the Pharaoh warped my soul.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:46.740
Rishido, on the day of the Gravekeepers' ritual, you endured the same pain I did.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.890
Rishido, save me!

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.820
Rishido!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.760
Rishido!

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.870
It hurts...

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.260
I'll change your bandages.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.730
Don't touch me!

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:13.480
Tell me, Rishido...

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.850
Who should I hate?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.850
Rishido?  What happened to your face?

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.790
I cannot stop your suffering.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.140
Rishido...

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:32.540
But I can pledge my loyalty to you and your family.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:41.700
Rishido, that's when you decided to share my burden of karma and destiny...

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:44.210
...and live in the darkness.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:49.900
Thanks to you, I was able to seal away my dark side.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.980
But it's over, Rishido.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:57.600
I don't know where your soul is.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:02.220
But you don't have to suffer anymore.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:07.730
Whether you're alive or dead, head towards the light.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.230
Thank you, Rishido.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:32.090
Yugi, I lost a lot of life points due to Obelisk's attack.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:35.590
But my set trap now activates.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.830
What?  A trap?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:44.530
No way!  I thought traps couldn't be used on a God's attack!

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:48.440
It's true that Counter Traps can't be used on a God.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:53.540
But this trap activates when my life points decrease.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:58.610
Witness my terrifying trap, Metal Reflect Slime!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.050
A trap monster!

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:09.940
This Slime Token uses its reflection effect to become a copy of your attacking monster.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:14.560
Its defense points are 3/4 of your monster's attack points.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.830
A copy of a God?

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.840
What is that?  Gross.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:32.640
That slime keeps changing shape and growing larger!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.430
It can't be!

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.160
That's...

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:52.720
Yes.  It's a copy of your God.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.170
Egyptian God Slime!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.630
Two Obelisks on the field!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.140
But one is a fake slime!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:31.640
Since it has 3000 defense points, Obelisk's attack can destroy it!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:35.140
He copied Obelisk so easily.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.600
Yugi will destroy that fake easily, right?

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:40.460
No.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:44.650
I don't think he copied Obelisk for defense only.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.900
A copy of a God...

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.670
But it can't copy a God's effects.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:03.400
If he's only using it for defense, I can destroy it next turn.  But...

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:08.410
I set a card and end my turn!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.650
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:17.060
I don't have a card that can retrieve Monster Reborn from my graveyard.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:22.220
I'll defend with Egyptian God Slime until I get a chance to summon Ra again.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:26.460
If I summon Ra, it'll destroy Obelisk instantly.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:31.570
Yugi, the theme of my deck is “immortality.”

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:36.470
It's built to keep reviving my God until I defeat you.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.240
Including Egyptian God Slime!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:44.080
I summon this monster.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:47.370
I summon Revival Jam in defense position.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.760
Revival Jam!

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:56.660
It's a regenerating monster that tormented me in my duel against the puppet.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.200
Will that destroy a God?

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:11.140
Even if I reflect back an attack, the slime blocks it!

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.380
Revival Jam has reformed.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.110
Next, I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:22.550
Polymerization!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:26.170
I fuse Egyptian God Slime and Revival Jam!

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.660
He's fusing Egyptian God Slime and Revival Jam?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.720
What?  It's still an Egyptian God Slime.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:52.010
No.  Something must be up.

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:55.870
It can't attack the turn that it's fused.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.520
My turn now ends.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.030
Marik fused to give more effects to Egyptian God Slime.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.180
But what are the effects?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.030
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:14.000
I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:20.260
Obelisk the Tormentor attacks Egyptian God Slime!

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.440
God Hand Crusher!

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.020
All right!

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.280
Did I destroy it?

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.770
Egyptian God Slime is regenerating.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.250
I knew it!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.770
That was pointless.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:14:00.020
By fusing, Egyptian God Slime has Revival Jam's regeneration effect!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.740
It can't be defeated.  In other words...

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.990
It's an immortal Egyptian God Slime.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.220
Immortal Egyptian God Slime?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:17.580
Damn!  Yugi can't deal Marik damage as long as he has Egyptian God Slime!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.570
He has to do something about that regeneration effect!

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.570
Yugi...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.070
Yugi...

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:30.300
Marik knew Yugi would summon the second God, Obelisk.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:37.150
He deliberately took the attack so that he could bring out his immortal Egyptian God Slime.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:43.590
Marik's terrifying strategy made Obelisk powerless.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.920
Can Yugi turn this around?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.100
I end my turn.

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:52.600
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:59.710
Marik is using Egyptian God Slime to defend and stall until he can get Monster Reborn.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:04.210
If he resurrects Ra, Obelisk will be destroyed instantly!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:13.490
Even if I get rid of Egyptian God Slime, I can't damage Marik.

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.490
What should I do?

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.650
Don't be perplexed, Yugi.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.740
Just wait for the darkness to devour you.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.880
That is your destiny.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.110
Here I go!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.610
I set a card!

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:37.960
I summon Bowganian in defense position!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.350
Bowganian!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:49.490
As long as it's on the field, it takes 300 life points from me every turn.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.090
Partner!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.760
I end my turn.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.270
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.270
I set a card!

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:06.020
I tribute Big Shield Gardna!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.900
I summon Dark Magician Girl!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:18.150
If I don't destroy Bowganian this turn, I'll lose life points.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.670
I can't let my partner suffer.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:25.890
Dark Magician Girl!  Attack Bowganian!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.000
Black Burning!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.500
Whoa.  I don't think so.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.840
I flip over my set card!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:39.010
The Continuous Trap, Jam Defender!

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:44.940
Due to Jam Defender's effect...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:50.140
...my immortal Egyptian God Slime intercepts any attack against my monsters.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.820
Send it back!

00:16:58.220 --> 00:16:59.730
Dark Magician Girl!

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:08.320
Due to my Continuous Trap Jam Defender, you can't destroy my monsters.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:13.620
Even if Obelisk attacks, my Continuous Trap activates.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:21.270
As long as Egyptian God Slime is on the field, me and my monsters are immortal.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.720
Partner!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:32.030
Before your turn ends, Bowganian's effect activates.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.080
Crossbow to Hell!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.800
My other self!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.580
Partner, are you okay?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.640
Yeah.  What about you?

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:52.640
My partner can't survive much longer.

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:53.880
What can I do?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:59.120
Oh my.  You're more concerned about each other?

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:01.600
You shouldn't be.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:04.410
Your fates are determined.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:09.780
The Gods and the Pharaoh are powerless against my overwhelming might!

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.360
You can only kneel before me in silence!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.110
While fearing your impending death!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.110
Yugi...

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:24.440
Damn!  He can't do anything against that slime?

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:26.120
Yugi!  Come on!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:30.840
What's up?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.820
Y-Yugi...

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:39.330
Yugi, you don't need to hold back.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.460
I'm prepared to die.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.340
Anzu?  What are you talking about?

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:51.070
Destroy me, along with the evil soul I created.

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.620
Anzu?

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:55.070
No, that's Marik!

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:56.620
Marik!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.640
Anzu?  What's going on?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:03.660
His consciousness is still inside her?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.320
How annoying!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:12.320
Yugi, I formed the Ghouls to kill you and avenge my father.

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:15.200
But that's not the truth.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:21.630
My other self killed my father!

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.270
Yes, you!

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.010
Hey, Anzu?

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:36.400
You should've realized that before I took control of your body.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:44.020
But you would've died anyway because you can't bear the weight of your sins.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.490
But I'll take you with me!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.550
That's impossible.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:51.750
Nobody can destroy me.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.820
Even the Pharaoh.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:58.680
What's wrong?

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.280
Get a grip, Anzu!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.680
Anzu!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.660
Marik!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.730
Ishizu?

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:05.860
Marik...

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.130
Sis...

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:10.880
What are you planning to do, Marik?

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.460
I'm sorry, Sis.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.360
This is my only option.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:15.250
Yugi!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:19.760
I know you can bury my evil soul into the darkness!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:22.760
This is the Pharaoh's final test!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.430
Marik...

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:29.430
Just give up and die, my host personality.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:35.040
There's no way for Yugi to defeat me.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.620
Let's continue the duel.

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:42.980
My turn!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.820
I draw!

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:50.420
I drew a card to get Monster Reborn back!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.830
I activate the spell card, Magical Stone Excavation!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.060
Magical Stone Excavation?

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:00.710
Due to Magical Stone Excavation's effect...

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:06.570
...I discard two cards from my hand to retrieve one spell card in my graveyard.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:10.810
And I choose Monster Reborn, of course.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.310
I'll Special Summon Ra next turn!

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:18.980
And that'll be your end!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:24.320
My other self!  There's always something you can do!

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:26.980
Yeah.  I know, partner.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.830
This will be my final gamble!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:33.130
Yugi...  Are you ready?

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:36.630
The darkness of death is right before your eyes!

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:59.970
Unless he defeats Marik, the darkness will devour Yugi!

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:03.840
But if defeats Marik, his real self will be erased!

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:10.880
Yugi can't attack unless he finds a way to defeat the evil Marik and save the true Marik.

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:13.340
Ra resurrected on Marik's field again!

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:17.310
Please survive, Yugi!  There must be something you can do!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:21.020
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Obelisk's Fury
Soul Energy MAX

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:22.550
Duel, standby!

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:39.980
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:48.320
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:59.480
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:09.000
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:18.030
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:23.540
I'll live feeling them

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.720
For me to be me

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:37.180
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:42.820
